         whether gazebo_ros_vacuum_gripper needed unobstructed overlap to
         detect grasp proximity. It didn't change the outcome (leg 1 still
         failed identically to every other leg), and we've since moved off
         vacuum_gripper entirely in favour of hexapod_link_attacher, so
         this link needs its normal physical collision back for standing/
         walking support. -->
